Package: zusbml
Title: Read, Write and Derive Equations from 'SBML' Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reads Systems Biology Markup Language ('SBML') core
    documents, Level 3 Versions 1 and 2 and Level 2 Versions 4 and 5, into
    one R object with a data frame per element kind. Writes that object
    back as valid Level 3 Version 2. Derives the states, initial values,
    right-hand sides, assignments and events that an ordinary differential
    equation solver needs, following the specification at
    <https://sbml.org/documents/specifications/>. Model math becomes R
    expressions that are evaluated without access to the rest of R, and
    constructs the package does not support are refused rather than
    approximated.
